    ],
    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "Back then, Father believed strength was the true arbiter
of justice. After discovering the virtue of violence, he
sought to become an Overlord.",
        "es": "Antes, padre creía que la fuerza lo era todo.
Quería volverse un Supremo y solo veía el valor
