    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "She had a weak constitution, and suffered from a
terminal illness. She lost her life giving birth to
Tichelle.",
        "es": "Su cuerpo era débil, y sufría una enfermedad
mortal. Y, al dar a luz a Tisiel, acabó perdiendo
