    [
      "key",
      "TALK_ID_3011_001_59",
    ],
    [
      140,
      Buffer [00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 4D 04 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00],
    ],
    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "Nobody knows when Chaos Canyon came to be. Researchers
are constantly debating their theories... Well, it's
more like idle chatter.",
        "es": "Nadie sabe de cuándo son las ruinas de Valle cruel. Los
investigadores más obsesivos vienen cada dos por tres y se
pasan el día debatiendo... o sea, charlando por los codos.",
        "fr": "Nul ne saurait dater les ruines de la Vallée Grobobo.
Le lieu accueille constamment des chercheurs qui
s’y retrouvent pour débattre, ou plutôt bavasser.",
        "jp": "渓酷の遺跡は、いつのものなのか誰も知らない。
熱心な研究家がたびたび訪れて、
日夜議論という名の雑談を繰り広げているぞ。",
        "ko": "가혹한 계곡의 유적이 언제 생겼는지는
아무도 몰라. 열정 넘치는 연구자가 종종
찾아와 밤낮으로 논의랍시고 잡담을 늘어놓지.",
        "zh-TW": "沒有人知道溪酷遺跡究竟建於什麼年代。
熱衷於研究的學者經常造訪，
以「研討」之名閒聊上一整天。",
      },
      "4.1",
      3,
      [
        Buffer [00 00 00 00],
        Buffer [00 00 00 00],
        Buffer [00 00 00 00],
      ],
    ],
    [
      148,
      Buffer [05 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00],
