    ],
    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "...I didn't see that comin'. It doesn't seem like they'd
get along.",
        "es": "No me lo puedo imaginar. No pegan
ni con cola.",
        "fr": "C’est surprenant, en effet. J’aurais jamais
imaginé ces deux-là s’entendre.",
        "jp": "……想像がつかん。
アイツらが馬が合うようには見えん。",
        "ko": "…상상이 안 되는군.
그놈들이 서로 마음이 맞을 것 같진 않은데.",
        "zh-TW": "……難以想像。
怎麼看都不覺得他們合得來。",
      },
      "4.3",
      2,
      [
        Buffer [00 00 00 00],
        Buffer [00 00 00 00],
      ],
    ],
    [
      128,
      Buffer [05 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 5D 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00],
    ],
    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "They didn't at first, meow. But while they were
battling, John-Zuck apparently impressed Cane by showing
him his "manly prowess"...",
        "es": "Al principio fue así, miau. Pero durante
su pelea, al parecer John Huck le demostró
su hombría.",
        "fr": "Apparemment, ça n’a pas toujours été le cas, mais
Rondinou aurait montré à Coqueluche qu’il était
« un vrai bonhomme » au cours d’un combat.",
        "jp": "実際最初はそうだったらしいんだけどニャ、
ワサン様と戦うときにジョンハック様が
『男を見せた』らしいんだニャ。",
        "ko": "실제로 처음엔 그랬다고 하는데
와산 님과 싸울 때 존핵 님이
『남자다움을 보여 줬다』고 들었다냥.",
        "zh-TW": "實際上最初似乎是那樣沒錯喵。
與瓦桑大人對戰時，喬哈克大人好像
「展現了男人的一面」喵。",
      },
      "4.5",
      3,
      [
        Buffer [00 00 00 00],
        Buffer [00 00 00 00],
        Buffer [00 00 00 00],
      ],
