    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "It's my UTMOST pleasure to make your acquaintance,
good sir. I'm Miss Tichelle's assistant. I hope you
enjoy your time here in the castle!",
        "es": "Encantadaaa.
Estoy ayudando a "Tisielita".
