    [
      "dialog",
      {
        "en": "...Right. For the record, I don't expect to be around
long, but yeah. Nice to meet you.",
        "es": "... Ah, vale.
Será una relación corta, pero encantado.",
        "fr": "Je compte pas rester longtemps,
